    "body": "This needs to update `getContextAttributes()` as well.\r\n\r\nI don't really like that we don't really have anything about a processing model here. It's fairly unusual to introduce enum members in this way as well. Normally enum members are defined in IDL and the processing model makes it clear what kind of impact they have. I guess this matches the `colorSpace` prior art, but at some point we'll have to refactor all of this to instead have proper processing models and that will be quite some work.",
